  ('parties', 'parties', 'Parties and definitions', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This agreement is made between {{eduwit.legal_name}}, {{eduwit.address}} (\"Eduwit\"), and {{creator.legal_name}} ({{creator.handle}}), {{creator.address}} (\"the Creator\")."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{{#if payee.is_agency}}Payments under this agreement are made to {{payee.name}}, acting for the Creator, who confirms its authority to receive them.{{/if}}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In this agreement:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"Deal\" means deal {{deal.code}} ({{deal.title}}) recorded on the Eduwit creator portal, including every accepted version of its terms."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"Deliverables\" means the content listed in the Scope clause."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"Portal\" means the Eduwit creator portal through which briefs, approvals, leads and payments are managed."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"Lead\" means a prospective student attributed to the Creator under the portal''s attribution rules."}]}]}]}]}'::jsonb, true, false, true, '{}'::text[]),
