{{#if deal.has_fees}}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Additional fees:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{{deal.fee_table}}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{{/if}}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Amounts become payable on the due dates shown and are paid in the Portal''s payout cycle to the bank account verified in the Creator''s KYC{{#if payee.is_agency}} or to the payee named above{{/if}}. Statements for every payment are available in the Portal."}]}]}'::jsonb, true, false, true, '{}'::text[]),
  ('taxes', 'taxes', 'Taxes (TDS and GST)', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eduwit deducts tax at source (TDS) as required by the Income-tax Act, 1961, at the rates applicable to each kind of payment, and issues TDS certificates through the Portal. Where the Creator has not provided a valid PAN, the higher rate prescribed by law applies."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{{#if creator.gst_registered}}The Creator is registered for GST ({{creator.gstin}}). GST is payable in addition to the fees on receipt of a valid tax invoice from the Creator.{{else}}The Creator confirms that it is not required to be registered for GST. The Creator will tell Eduwit promptly if this changes.{{/if}}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Each party bears its own other taxes."}]}]}'::jsonb, true, false, true, '{}'::text[]),
  ('content_approval', 'content_approval', 'Content approval and revisions', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Creator submits concepts, scripts and drafts through the Portal before publication. Eduwit reviews them within a reasonable time and may request revisions up to the limit set in the brief."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Content may be published only after Eduwit''s approval in the Portal. Approved content may not be changed materially without a new approval."}]}]}'::jsonb, false, true, false, '{}'::text[]),
  ('disclosure', 'disclosure', 'ASCI disclosure and advertising standards', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every piece of content made under this agreement is advertising. The Creator will clearly disclose the paid partnership as required by the Advertising Standards Council of India (ASCI) guidelines for influencer advertising and the Consumer Protection Act, 2019, using the disclosure labels required for each platform, placed so that they are prominent and not hidden among other text."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Creator will comply with the ASCI Code and the platforms'' branded-content rules."}]}]}'::jsonb, true, false, true, '{}'::text[]),
  ('claims', 'claims', 'Claims and accuracy', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Creator will make only the claims about programmes, universities, fees, placements and outcomes that Eduwit has approved in the brief. The Creator will not promise admission, scholarships, jobs, salaries or results, and will not compare programmes or institutions in a misleading way."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If Eduwit tells the Creator that a published claim is inaccurate, the Creator will correct or remove it within 24 hours."}]}]}'::jsonb, true, false, true, '{}'::text[]),
  ('usage_rights', 'usage_rights', 'Usage rights and intellectual property', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Creator owns the content it creates. The Creator grants Eduwit a non-exclusive licence to share, embed and refer to the published content on Eduwit''s own channels for the term of this agreement."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{{#if deal.has_fees}}Any wider rights (paid amplification, whitelisting, use in Eduwit''s advertising or for a longer period) are granted only as listed in the additional fees of the Compensation clause, for the platforms and duration stated there.{{/if}}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eduwit''s names, logos and materials remain Eduwit''s property and may be used only for the deliverables."}]}]}'::jsonb, false, true, false, '{}'::text[]),
  ('exclusivity', 'exclusivity', 'Exclusivity and non-compete', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For the period and category stated in the exclusivity fee of the Compensation clause, the Creator will not promote competing education services or platforms, including other edtech or admission-counselling businesses, on the platforms stated."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Content already published before this agreement is not affected."}]}]}'::jsonb, false, true, false, '{}'::text[]),
  ('confidentiality', 'confidentiality', 'Confidentiality', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Each party keeps confidential the other''s non-public information received under this agreement, including commercial terms, briefs before publication and Portal data, and uses it only for this agreement. This obligation survives for two years after the agreement ends, except where disclosure is required by law."}]}]}'::jsonb, false, true, false, '{}'::text[]),
  ('data_protection', 'data_protection', 'Data protection', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Each party will comply with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and related rules. The Creator will not collect students'' personal data directly (for example phone numbers or email addresses in messages or comments) and will direct prospective students to Eduwit''s links, codes and channels."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lead information shown in the Portal is provided only to measure the Creator''s performance; contact details are masked and must not be sought, copied or shared."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eduwit processes the Creator''s personal data (including KYC details) as described in its privacy notice for creators."}]}]}'::jsonb, true, false, true, '{}'::text[]),
  ('conduct', 'conduct', 'Conduct and reputation', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DRAFT — requires legal review before use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"During the term, the Creator will not publish content that is unlawful, defamatory, hateful, obscene or likely to bring Eduwit or its partner institutions into disrepute. If the Creator becomes involved in a public controversy that may affect Eduwit, the parties will discuss in good faith, and Eduwit may pause or end the deal under the Termination clause."}]}]}'::jsonb, false, true, false, '{}'::text[]),
